      { "speaker": "Thomas", "native": "സാരമില്ല! കൊള്ളാം, നല്ല മലയാളം.", "roman": "sāramilla! koḷḷām, nalla malayāḷam.", "en": "No problem! Not bad — good Malayalam." },
